# Wedding Site — Cursor Rules

You are helping build a **static, read-only** Next.js wedding site. Canonical docs: **`AGENTS.md`**, **`docs/MAINTAINING.md`**, **`README.md`**. Numbered specs **`00`–`12`** are historical. For photos, gallery, or the save-the-date reel, delegate to the **`wedding-photos`** subagent (`.cursor/agents/wedding-photos.md`).

## Critical constraints

Never create: on-site RSVP / attendance / guest tracking; chatbot or AI widget; public contact `<form>`; gallery upload; login; database; API routes; server actions; middleware locale redirects; analytics in MVP.

The **only** RSVP is the home `#rsvp` band linking to the couple's Google Form (`homeShell.rsvpFormUrl`). Guest support is the FAQ page. There is **no LINE Official Account**.

## Product truth

**Visible naming (bride-first):** `Tan & Top` · `Narueporn & Theerut`. Never groom-first in UI.

**Routing** (`trailingSlash: true` in production):

- English (root): `/`, `/schedule/`, `/venue/`, `/gallery/`, `/faq/`
- Thai: `/th/`, `/th/schedule/`, `/th/venue/`, `/th/gallery/`, `/th/faq/`

Logo goes **home**: `/` (English) or `/th/` (Thai). Do **not** restore `/en/`, Accommodation, or Dress-code.

**Home order:** envelope → collage → Conrad (`#invitation`) → save-the-date film (`#film`) → `#rsvp` → scallop frame → timeline → photo band → quick actions. The reel is **home-only**, not on the gallery.

**Thai “Save the date”** idiom is **จองวันไว้เลยนะ** (not เซฟเดอะเดท / บันทึกวันสำคัญ). English stays “Save the date”.

**Paper:** cream / ivory / paper / page `bg` = **`#fff5e6`**. Do **not** retint envelope olive tokens (`envelope`, `envelope-deep`, `envelope-soft`, `backdrop`) when changing cream.

## Stack

- Next.js App Router **16.2.x**, TypeScript strict, Tailwind v4, **pnpm only**
- Fonts: Bellefair (`font-display`) · Perandory (`CoupleScriptMark`) · Inter · IBM Plex Sans Thai
- **NT monogram:** `TNMonogram` → `public/brand/logo.svg` via `publicAssetPath`. Navbar is logo-only. Give the wrapper a real width (`aspect-ratio`); iOS Safari collapses SVG `img` with only a `viewBox`. Do not restore `nt-monogram.png`, Allura, or a geometric T-over-N.
- Static export (`output: 'export'`), `images.unoptimized: true`
- `GITHUB_PAGES=true` → `basePath` `/top-tanly-wedding`

## Files

- Components: PascalCase, default export, `cn()` for `className`
- Content: `content/th/*.ts` + `content/en/*.ts` + `content/schema.ts` — **never hardcode guest copy in JSX**
- Public URLs in JSX: `publicAssetPath()`
- Default Server Components. `"use client"` only for menus, accordions, motion, locale, video

## Styling

Minimal invitation: cream paper, near-black ink, **no florals**. Prefer `charcoal` / `stone` / `cream` / `ivory`. Legacy `olive` / `gold` names are ink/taupe, not green. No colored CTAs. Cards `rounded-2xl`/`rounded-3xl`, media `rounded-xl`, buttons `rounded-full`.

**Never widen tracking on Thai.** English eyebrows: letter-spaced uppercase. Bellefair is one weight — do not fake bold.

After `@theme` colour changes, delete `.next` if HMR keeps the old cream.

## Photos (summary)

Originals in `photos-src/` are gitignored except `.gitkeep`. Convert with `pnpm photos` (or `node scripts/optimize-photos.mjs`). Commit **only** `public/images/**` and `public/videos/save-the-date.mp4`.

- **Never overwrite** Conrad `venue` / `venue-2`
- Home **band-1…3** must mix **different sets** (studio + first-outing rings), not three studio stills
- Gallery must **not** open on ชุดไทย; open on motion-blur street stills (`street-34`, `street-289`, `street-278`, `street-260`). Rebuild street tiles from the dump: delete existing `*-street-*` gallery files, then copy every `photos-src/all-photos/street` original. Thai dress sits later.
- Reel: tap-to-play **with sound**; no muted autoplay; `prefers-reduced-motion` = poster only
- Do not wrap below-the-fold photos in `aria-hidden` + `Reveal` `opacity: 0` + `loading="lazy"` — Chromium will never fetch them

## Navigation

Mobile (`lg`↓): `MobileBottomNav` — Home · Schedule · Venue · Gallery · FAQ. No RSVP / Gift / LINE / Accommodation / Dress-code.

Desktop: Schedule · Venue · Gallery · FAQ · language toggle.

## Motion

`Reveal` (`motion/react`), reduced-motion = duration 0, **keep the motion node mounted**. No parallax, marquees, or motion on schedule/map facts.

## What NOT to do

- Florals, colored CTAs, `/en/` routes, hardcoded copy, runtime fetches for guest facts
- Invented operational claims in alt text or FAQ
- Spelling `Vanue`
